(UTTARAKHAND STATE DISASTER MANAGEMENT AUTHORITY) Tj T*
(DISTRICT DISASTER MANAGEMENT AUTHORITY   DEHRADUN) Tj T*
(FLASH FLOOD & CLOUDBURST EMERGENCY ADVISORY) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Advisory No.: DDMA/DDN/2024/087) Tj T*
(Date: 14 August 2024  |  Time: 05:30 IST) Tj T*
(Issued By: District Collector, Dehradun) Tj T*
(Classification: URGENT   IMMEDIATE ACTION REQUIRED) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                                                            ) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. DISASTER OVERVIEW) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Type: Flash Flood and Cloudburst) Tj T*
(Severity: EXTREME) Tj T*
(Primary River: Rispana River) Tj T*
(Secondary River: Song River) Tj T*
(Affected District: Dehradun, Uttarakhand) Tj T*
(Issuing Authority: District Disaster Management Authority, Dehradun) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Continuous heavy rainfall of 180mm recorded in the past 6 hours over the) Tj T*
(Mussoorie hills has caused the Rispana River to breach its banks at multiple) Tj T*
(points. The Song River is also running at 94% of its danger level. Cloudbursts) Tj T*
(have been reported over the Rajpur Road catchment area. Flash floods are) Tj T*
(actively inundating low-lying localities in the eastern and southern parts of) Tj T*
(Dehradun city. Landslide risk is HIGH on all hill-facing roads.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                                                            ) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. ZONE CLASSIFICATION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(RED ZONE   IMMEDIATE EVACUATION ORDERED:) Tj T*
(The following localities are under active flood inundation or face imminent) Tj T*
(inundation within the next 60 minutes. All residents must evacuate immediately.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  - Kandoli \(near Rispana River bank, eastern Dehradun\)) Tj T*
(    Coordinates: 30.3200 N, 78.0600 E) Tj T*
(    Status: Active flooding. Water level 1.2m above road level.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  - Niranjanpur \(low-lying area, Rispana floodplain\)) Tj T*
(    Coordinates: 30.3050 N, 78.0450 E) Tj T*
(    Status: Roads submerged. Evacuation route via NH-72 only.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  - Sewla Kalan \(Song River adjacent, southern Dehradun\)) Tj T*
(    Coordinates: 30.2900 N, 78.0350 E) Tj T*
(    Status: Song River overflow. 3 residential colonies cut off.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(AMBER ZONE   HIGH ALERT, PREPARE TO EVACUATE:) Tj T*
(The following localities are at elevated risk. Residents should pack essentials) Tj T*
(and be ready to move on short notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  - Raipur \(mid-elevation, Rajpur Road corridor\)) Tj T*
(    Coordinates: 30.3400 N, 78.1100 E) Tj T*
(    Status: Landslide debris on Rajpur Road. Partial road closure.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  - Majra \(western Dehradun, near Bindal River tributary\)) Tj T*
ET
