(8. IMMEDIATE INSTRUCTIONS TO PUBLIC) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Residents of Kandoli, Niranjanpur, and Sewla Kalan must evacuate NOW.) Tj T*
(2. Do not attempt to cross flooded roads or bridges.) Tj T*
(3. Move to the nearest shelter on higher ground.) Tj T*
(4. Call 112 for emergency rescue. Call 1077 for SDRF.) Tj T*
(5. Do not use Rispana Bridge Road or Sewla Kalan Link Road.) Tj T*
(6. Carry essential medicines, documents, and 3 days of food.) Tj T*
(7. Help elderly and disabled neighbours to evacuate.) Tj T*
(8. Do not spread unverified information on social media.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                                                            ) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. WEATHER FORECAST) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(IMD Dehradun forecast: Heavy to very heavy rainfall expected to continue for) Tj T*
(the next 12 hours. Red alert issued for Dehradun district. Flood situation) Tj T*
(expected to worsen before 14:00 IST. All residents in low-lying areas must) Tj T*
(complete evacuation before 08:00 IST.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                                                            ) Tj T*
